  "updated_at": "2026-01-15T20:51:02.282021+00:00",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1002/cne.920180503",
  "reference": "Yerkes, R.M. & Dodson, J.D. (1908) The relation of strength of stimulus to rapidity of habit-formation. J. Comp. Neurol. Psychol. 18:459-482"
}